        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Design and finalise the training modules and wellbeing protocol.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 45680,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, based on the initial findings from the needs analysis, I've drafted some ideas for the communication training modules (T3). The main themes are handling frustration and managing expectations. I'm thinking of three core modules: 1. 'Active Listening Under Pressure', 2. 'Setting Clear Boundaries Politely', and 3. 'De-escalating with Empathy'. What are your thoughts?",
            "mentions": [
              56723,
              4784,
              605,
              89425
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 89425,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Those topics sound spot on. In parallel, I've created the draft for the Desk-based Wellbeing Protocol, A4, for T4. It includes 6 simple, low-impact stretching and breathing exercises that can be done at a desk in under 3 minutes. I've checked them against standard safety guidelines and focused on accessibility for all fitness levels. The instructions are ready for review.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "muscle",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 56723,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Excellent, @89425. I'll review A4 from an HR policy perspective today. @45680, the module topics seem very relevant. Will they include role-playing with real call scenarios?",
            "mentions": [
              89425,
              45680
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 4784,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "The titles sound good. We need to make sure it's not just theory.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 45680,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "Absolutely. My plan is for each module to be 70% practical exercises and role-playing. I'll be pulling anonymized examples from our call logs to build the scenarios. I'll also create a simple one-page job aid (A3) with key phrases and tips that staff can keep at their desks.",
            "mentions": [
              56723
