            "speaker_id": 56723,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, as we finalize the program content, I've completed the Policy & Compliance Review Checklist (A7) for T11. All elements, including session length and micro-breaks, are compliant with labour legislation and our internal HR policies. I've also drafted a Program Governance & Ownership Note (A8) to clarify roles for a potential future rollout (T10). Please review.",
