            "speaker_id": 56723,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi everyone, the pilot sessions are complete and we've achieved an 85% response rate on the feedback survey (T9). I've compiled the results into the draft Feedback & Impact Evaluation Report, A6. Please take a look. Key highlights: the wellbeing micro-breaks were a huge hit. However, feedback on the 'Setting Boundaries' module was mixed; many found it too theoretical.",
