            "speaker_id": 45680,
            "reply_to": "M59",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing, @56723. The feedback on the 'Setting Boundaries' module doesn't surprise me. I observed during the sessions that participants struggled to apply the concepts without more concrete examples. For the next wave, I strongly recommend we replace it with a more hands-on module focused entirely on role-playing difficult call scenarios.",
            "mentions": [
