            "speaker_id": 45680,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "So, to summarize the proposed changes for the next wave: 1. Keep the wellbeing protocol, but enhance it with the two new exercises suggested by @89425. 2. Keep the 'Active Listening' and 'De-escalating' modules as they were well-received. 3. Drop the 'Setting Boundaries' module and replace it with a new, practical 'Advanced Role-Play Scenarios' module. Does this sound like the right plan?",
